	measure 'C LCL' = ```
			
			
			
			VAR c_total = CALCULATE([Total Value],ALL('Date Reference'))
			
			VAR k = CALCULATE(COUNT([Reporting_Date]),ALL('Date Reference'))
			
			VAR c_value = c_total / k
			
			VAR C_LCL = IF(SUM('Metrics'[Value]) = BLANK(), BLANK(), 
			            c_value - 
			            SQRT(c_value)*3)
			
			RETURN IF(C_LCL < 0, 0, C_LCL)
			```
